Server init.

>> x := Blob nobo: 65 tipo: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programa konfigurashon: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server konektá-ku: (
 Lista nobo ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Lista nobo ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x kuminsá: 0 largura: 1), liña-nobo.
x libra.

